        "# **SVM — Support  Vector Machines**"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ArppOEVd3YLF"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Support Vector Machine** (**SVM**) is a **Supervised Machine-Learning** algorithm primarily\n",
        "used for classification problems. Its main objective is to find an **optimal decision**\n",
        "**boundary** (**hyperplane**) that separates observations belonging to different classes while\n",
        "maximizing **the margin** between the classes.\n",
        "The observations located closest to the decision boundary are called **Support Vectors**.\n",
        "These observations are particularly important because they determine the position of the\n",
        "optimal separating hyperplane. **SVM** can also **handle more complex classification**\n",
        "problems through the use of different **kernel functions**, which allow the model to construct\n",
        "**nonlinear decision** boundaries"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "BC-X8G0J3bRf"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
